From 7698e7018e3d5d68815d34b638e77c9633217dd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rkvenc forward-port <forward-port@local>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 16:48:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 96/96] video: rockchip: mpp: serialize task and fault
 ownership

Serialize session control, result collection, and DMA cache lookup so reset, poll, import, release, and task construction cannot race their owned state. Balance static translation references, preserve interrupted link waits, and force unsafe hard CCU requests onto the soft worker before hook selection.

Reserve IOMMU fault admission per task before provider preparation, publish the task before START, and enable delivery afterward without acknowledging a newly latched fault. Harden provider device links, shared-IRQ attribution, callback quiescence, runtime-PM handling, and task teardown across Rockchip and VSI providers.
